/TU (Graph demonstrating a cooler capacity forecast using the SARIMA m\(52\) \(0,1,0\)\(1,0,0\) model. It features lines for the threshold of total and target capacities measured in pallet positions, previous time-series data, a 26-week forecast path, and a credible interval shaded to denote forecast reliability.)
